Non CE : Sentence should be more organize (Sir, the NID card you shared is a smart NID card, you can register the SIM with your old NID card.
), the customer questions in Bengali during an English conversation., CM did not response to customer timely., CM needs to use magical words like sorry, thank you as per scenario., #LateClosing As per the chat closing process, the Customer Manager should have closed the chat within 35–45 seconds after pre-closing; however, the CM took 1 min 32 sec to close the chat.
CE : The customer wanted to crossmatch his SIM card with his registered NID and shared the last 4 digits (7172). The CM communicated that the customer’s provided NID number was matched . Which is wrong .
